  13: [['MACK', 'The Saint of All Colors is back where it came from, and the rain filled the hole behind it. Rain City is grey. Grey and wet and honest and mine.'], ['MACK', 'I walked thirteen cases to get to this stool. I\'m going to sit on it a while.'], ['SALLY', 'Who cares, Mack! We beat HELL! Gus! Everything! Every bottle! Dottie, call the coffee machine, we\'re having a wedding!']],
  0: [['MACK', 'Another night on the streets. Another gutter washed clean. The city never says thank you. The city just keeps raining.'], ['SALLY', 'Gus! The quiet man wants a drink. I want two. I worked twice as hard. I fired forty rockets.']],
